# What `eas build` uploads — READ THIS BEFORE EDITING .gitignore
#
# eas-cli does NOT upload what git tracks. It copies the WORKING TREE through
# its own ignore matcher, and while this file exists it uses it INSTEAD of every
# .gitignore in the repo (root and android/). Two consequences:
#
#   1. `/android` in .gitignore is deliberately ABSENT here. This is a bare
#      project: android/ is hand-hardened (manifest permissions, R8, signing)
#      and must reach the worker as-is. With .gitignore in charge the whole
#      directory was silently dropped, EAS found no gradlew and every cloud
#      build died in FIX_GRADLEW (2026-09-18, builds 1-4).
#   2. Every exclusion we still want has to be repeated below, including the
#      rules that used to live in android/.gitignore.
#
# eas-cli always adds `.git` and `node_modules` on top of this list.

# ---- Expo / Metro / TypeScript -------------------------------------------
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts
.metro-health-check*
*.tsbuildinfo
.kotlin/

# ---- native build output (was android/.gitignore) -------------------------
/ios/
/android/build/
/android/app/build/
/android/.gradle/
/android/.cxx/
/android/app/.cxx/
/android/local.properties
/android/*.log
/android/*.hprof
/android/app/*.hprof
*.iml
.idea/
*.jsbundle

# ---- secrets: never in the upload archive ----------------------------------
# google-services.json is materialised on the worker by scripts/eas-pre-install.js
# from the GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON file secret; EXPO_PUBLIC_* come from the EAS
# "production" environment (eas env:list --environment production).
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
credentials.json
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.pem
.env
.env.*
**/.env
*.env

# ---- local tooling / scratch / large media ---------------------------------
supabase.exe
supabase/.temp/
.claude/
.claude-check/
.superpowers/
web/
*.log
bundle_check.txt
bundle_out.txt
/*.png
*.bak
*.orig.*
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*
.DS_Store
scripts/technique-clips/out/
scripts/technique-clips/raw/
eas-build-*.status.json
eas-build-*.worker.log
